# Always check out text files with LF. The service worker hashes the build
# output (ngsw.json); CRLF sources produce CRLF assets that git normalizes to LF
# when angular-cli-ghpages commits them, so deployed files no longer match.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
